    <title>038 2026夏秋游戏小推荐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab117b393d5eb3bdc78cc1b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab117b393d5eb3bdc78cc1b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：阿盐、阿九</span></p><p><span>选择“2026夏秋游戏小推荐”作为本期话题的原因包括但不限于：</span></p><p><span>1、阿盐和阿九又玩了一批游戏啦~~迫不及待分享给大家！</span></p><p><span>2、2026真是个游戏大年啊，今年好玩的游戏也太多了</span></p><p><span>3、为啥不叫下半年游戏推荐呢？因为年底还有太多大作要发售了哈哈哈哈</span></p><p><span>4、这次推荐的很多游戏几个小时就能打完，爽哉爽哉</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期推荐的游戏，括号内是游戏类型：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="257">04:17</a> 加利宅邸悬案（推理）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 账单必须支付 Bills Must Be Paid（增量）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a> 婆罗洲的红珍珠（推理、免费！）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1693">28:13</a> 喵喵的结合（肉鸽、战棋）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 喂龙高手（牌组构建、轻度肉鸽）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">36:34</a> 绯花绽放（心理恐怖）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> Big Walk（多人合作探索解谜）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3392">56:32</a> 罗格：救世传说（幸存者like）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4365">72:45</a> 桌面探索者（解谜）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4603">76:43</a> 卡厄斯梦境（杀戮尖塔like、手游）</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
