    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a34f95a4233e62bc54c586d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jun 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：阿盐、阿九</span></p><p><span>1、两位首发都玩了这款游戏的主播终于在夏促前补上了这一期</span></p><p><span>2、爽、爽、爽，此等爽游，必须要狠狠推荐给大家！</span></p><p><span>3、爽游体验不可能彻底取代肉鸽DBG的传统模式，但新的赛道冉冉升起</span></p><p><span>4、脑子怎么长的啊我们也想要~~~</span></p><p></p><p><span>时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> 冷问题time！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 椒盐米九在吸血鬼爬行者发售前和发售后的初体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 吸血鬼幸存者和Roguelike Deckbuilding Game的小介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> 吸血鬼爬行者与传统肉鸽DBG的异同和设计元素（甚至多到忘记聊overkill了）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">36:34</a> 宽松性但正反馈的设计下，随机性带来的体验差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2699">44:59</a> 近期肉鸽DBG的环境和吸血鬼爬行者背后的团队</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3399">56:39</a> co-dev联合开发值得期待</span></p><p></p><p><span>BGM</span></p><p><span>Colorful Flowers by Tokyo Music Walker</span></p><p><span>Music promoted by chosic.com</span></p><p><span>Creative Commons CC BY 3.0</span></p>]]></description>
