  <item>
    <title>SP09 2026年游戏大作推荐与前瞻 feat.日谈公园</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a267316b30e1571aea29331</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a267316b30e1571aea29331</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 07:53:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期阿盐和王师傅串台 日谈公园，畅聊26年游戏体验和展望~</span></p><p></p><p><span>主播｜小伙子 （日谈公园） </span></p><p><span>嘉宾｜Mikasa（火象三傻妙妙屋）女王盐  王师傅</span></p><p><span>2026年是一个游戏大年，会有很多重磅的游戏发售。本期节目就来盘点一下上半年发售的那些游戏，也对下半年即将发售的游戏进行前瞻。</span></p><p><span>你将会听到：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a>&nbsp;喵乐迪：律动幸存者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a>&nbsp;生化危机9:安魂曲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a>&nbsp;仁王3</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a>&nbsp;宝可梦&nbsp;Pokopia</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a>&nbsp;冒险家艾略特的千年奇谭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a>&nbsp;古墓丽影：亚特兰蒂斯遗迹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a>&nbsp;007&nbsp;初露锋芒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">39:11</a>&nbsp;关于AI游戏的小探讨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2684">44:44</a>&nbsp;识质存在</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2917">48:37</a>&nbsp;杀戮尖塔2</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2993">49:53</a>&nbsp;球比伦战记</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3188">53:08</a>&nbsp;鲁特里一家死了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3309">55:09</a>&nbsp;真探</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3385">56:25</a>&nbsp;联机谜踪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3503">58:23</a>&nbsp;TBH：塔斯克巴英雄</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3639">01:00:39</a>&nbsp;GTA6</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3815">01:03:35</a>&nbsp;影之刃零</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3860">01:04:20</a>&nbsp;队长小翼2&nbsp;世界群星</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3914">01:05:14</a>&nbsp;鬼武者：剑之道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3983">01:06:23</a>&nbsp;节奏天国&nbsp;奇迹之星</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4107">01:08:27</a>&nbsp;舞力全开手机版</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4198">01:09:58</a>&nbsp;昭和米国物语</span></p><p><span>玩吧！</span></p><p></p><p><span>|Song List|</span></p><p><span>Lana Del Rey - First Light</span></p>]]></description>
