  <item>
    <title>030 出差/旅行必吃榜！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b901a6f8b8079bfac860d5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b901a6f8b8079bfac860d5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Mar 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：阿盐、阿九</span></p><span></span><p><span>选择“出差必吃榜！”作为本期话题的原因包括但不限于：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、都叫椒盐米九了，结果第30期才聊吃的，可真有我们的！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、想推荐的竟然多到一期说不完，这回先聊上海、成都、北京和一些其他旅游城市</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、辣的不辣的、清淡的香口的、本地的海外的都有！</span></p><span></span><p><span>4、剪辑完这一期的阿盐：“受不了了，来吃烧鸟自助了……”阿九：“啊，我，刚吃完沙茶火锅出来……”就这么好吃！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴（店名附在最后噢，太多了，就不放在时间轴啦）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">0:23</a> 冷问题time！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 椒盐米九上海站必吃榜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a> 阿盐在珠海吃到的美食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 阿盐前年（录音中口误说成了去年）去了新疆自驾游！美景与美食分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a> 常飞成都的阿九吃到了很多当地人都说好的美食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3376">56:16</a> 椒盐米九北京站必吃榜（太多了以至于广州站得再开一期）</span></p><span></span><p><span>上海站：</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢饮光临</span></p><span></span><p><span>DK台湾菜馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>大志和牛寿喜烧</span></p><span></span><p><span>浦东清真寺烧烤（现在好像搬了，名字叫做源深路烧烤）</span></p><span></span><p><span>吴记鲜定味</span></p><span></span><p><span>老门框 涮羊肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>庄淑芬 厦门沙茶火锅</span></p><span></span><p><span>岳GAKU日本料理</span></p><span></span><p><span>BAMBINO</span></p><span></span><p><span>THE CANNERY</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tacolicious</span></p><span></span><p><span>东吴石府</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏味馆（机场店）</span></p><span></span><p><span>珠海站：</span></p><span></span><p><span>得食菜馆顺德菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>乌鲁木齐站：</span></p><span></span><p><span>柴窝堡22号辣子鸡</span></p><span></span><p><span>成都站：</span></p><span></span><p><span>胖姐家小菜馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>五里关火锅（小关庙店）</span></p><span></span><p><span>玉姐夜蹄花</span></p><span></span><p><span>润祥楼</span></p><span></span><p><span>孔干饭</span></p><span></span><p><span>坛罐肴 腰花饭店</span></p><span></span><p><span>西月城谭豆花</span></p><span></span><p><span>到家张醪糟</span></p><span></span><p><span>鸡毛店</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nick&amp;Nicky's Family妮琪泰式家庭料理</span></p><span></span><p><span>苏坦土耳其西餐厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>功夫抄手（东升街店）</span></p><span></span><p><span>吐真剂</span></p><span></span><p><span>北京站：</span></p><span></span><p><span>螺狮粉：熊先生、肥姨妈、水平有限</span></p><span></span><p><span>川菜：老川办、新煮意</span></p><span></span><p><span>王老六铁锅炖鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>居酒屋：虎铁、鱼清、秋本寿司</span></p><span></span><p><span>烧鸟自助：鸟乐居</span></p><span></span><p><span>日式拉面：日出拉面</span></p><span></span><p><span>韩料：喇喇排骨火锅</span></p><span></span><p><span>烤肉：新哥烤肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>椰子鸡：烹然四季</span></p><span></span><p><span>羊肉：哈啾嗨·民族特色菜、313羊庄铁锅烀羊肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>烈马墨西哥餐吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>Colorful Flowers by Tokyo Music Walker</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music promoted by chosic.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>Creative Commons CC BY 3.0</span></p>]]></description>
