  <item>
    <title>029 和发行制作人聊聊《无限机兵》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a5f15ea22480add6bab9a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a5f15ea22480add6bab9a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Mar 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：嘉伟</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：阿盐、阿九</span></p><span></span><p><span>选择“和发行制作人聊聊《无限机兵》”作为本期话题的原因包括但不限于：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、恭喜《无限机兵》即将推出DLC~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、一起聊聊“发行制作人”的概念</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、也一起来听这个规模和体量在开发把控上的经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>4、还有许许多多发行行业的细节分享~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">0:35</a> 嘉宾嘉伟介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">1:07</a> 冷问题time！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">2:20</a> 发行制作人是什么？为什么在国内比较少见呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">9:41</a> 嘉伟曾经杀入过全球白金200名内</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 我们所处的行业现状与时代特征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a> 发行制作人为什么那么注重沟通能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 关于co-dev联合开发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 嘉伟对《无限机兵》的介绍，与美好的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2411">40:11</a> 中电博亚为什么会选择签约《无限机兵》？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3156">52:36</a> 开发团队的状态十分重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3819">1:03:39</a> 首发出现严重bug，应该怎么办呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4271">1:11:11</a> “你得反复地尝试”</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vibin by Purple Cat</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music promoted by chosic.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>Creative Commons CC BY 3.0</span></p>]]></description>
