    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是在“元动力玩家文化节”上，阿九和《游乐搭子》线下串台的一期٩(•̤̀ᵕ•̤́๑)</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：月狸（@</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6690900e1083d56d9ccf29ab" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6690900e1083d56d9ccf29ab"><span>游乐搭子</span></a><span>）、后山狗（@</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6690900e1083d56d9ccf29ab" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6690900e1083d56d9ccf29ab"><span>游乐搭子</span></a><span>）、阿九</span></p><span></span><p><span>狸狗和阿九聊了在各个游戏展会玩耍的体验，阿九还分享了作为揽月主办方的视角，最后也尝试总结了一些实用建议，希望能帮助大家更好的享受游戏展~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">0:48</a> 椒盐米九与游乐搭子的两次见面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="431">7:11</a> 冷问题时间！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">8:48</a> 逛展就是开心！快乐与感动时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a> 布展汗流浃背！关于阿九救过的火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2212">36:52</a> 下次一定！参展和布展都用得上的实用tips</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>キルトのまち - 毛糸のカービィOST</span></p>]]></description>
