  <item>
    <title>028 春节假期游戏推荐！20款长长长游戏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69882f3666e2c303776672de</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69882f3666e2c303776672de</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：阿盐、阿九</span></p><span></span><p><span>选择“春节推荐！20款长长长游戏”作为本期话题的原因包括但不限于：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、给大家拜个早年啦~~马上富贵！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、虽说是20款，但任何1款通关可能春节就过去了……</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、新老游戏交替，不同价位均有</span></p><span></span><p><span>4、欧美、日式；战斗、解谜；紧张刺激、休闲放松也都有~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>*口胡：阿九把《六角疑云》说成了《接线疑云》*</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴（自带游戏列表版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">0:54</a> 冷问题time！（来听这个阿盐笑场）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">2:24</a> 盐选：羊蹄山之魂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 九选：勇者斗恶龙I &amp; II HD-2D Remake还有3和系列</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">34:36</a> 盐选：仁王3</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 九选：黑魂3和系列（进行一些倒追时间的行为）</span></p><span></span><p><span>————因为前边聊太嗨占了时长，下边都是简短推荐————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">54:30</a> 鲁特里一家死了/金偶像疑案和金偶像崛起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3424">57:04</a> 空之轨迹 the 1st/天外世界/永恒之柱1/Tactics Ogre: Reborn</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3627">1:00:27</a> 魔法少女的魔女审判/AI LIMIT 无限机兵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3821">1:03:41</a> 炼金工房（工作室）系列：阿兰德、黄昏、不可思议三部曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4181">1:09:41</a> 双点博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4489">1:14:49</a> 邪恶铭刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4795">1:19:55</a> 双影奇境/八方旅人0/终末地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5224">1:27:04</a> XCOM系列/奇异人生1和前传风暴前夕</span></p><span></span><p><span>（还胡乱抛了个意图单开一期喷《重返寂静岭》的钩子）</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>Colorful Flowers by Tokyo Music Walker</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music promoted by chosic.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>Creative Commons CC BY 3.0</span></p>]]></description>
