  <item>
    <title>027 阿盐和阿九的游戏创业滋味 2025版</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698171042fc7f49d0976cd70</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698171042fc7f49d0976cd70</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Feb 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：阿盐、阿九</span></p><span></span><p><span>选择“阿盐和阿九的游戏创业滋味2025版”作为本期话题的原因包括但不限于：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、一转眼我们各自做游戏已经一年啦~踩过不少坑，也积累了一些血泪经验</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、阿盐和阿九都是远程办公做独立游戏，慢慢摸索出了一点技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、关于游戏开发的必然：延期，与亏本的风险</span></p><span></span><p><span>4、做独立游戏真的苦，尤其是初期项目，也分享一点熬下去的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">0:41</a> 冷问题time！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">1:44</a> 阿九选择在游戏创业的前世今生（x）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a> 阿盐想要开发自己的游戏更是由来已久</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 阿九以公司形式运营的小小分享：风险和坚持，还有成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 《伦敦旧影》的失误和补救，《姐姐恋爱法则》的提前准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2596">43:16</a> 阿盐的《喵乐迪：律动幸存者》：音乐设计上的动作玩法机制、联合开发与测试反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3683">1:01:23</a> 我们到底应该用什么样的眼光看待独立游戏的开发呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3872">1:04:32</a> 管理自己的预期，与如何100%保证回本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4035">1:07:15</a> 如果失败了呢？失败以后，又该怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4214">1:10:14</a> 远程办公形式开发独立游戏的利与弊，怎么提高效率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4530">1:15:30</a> 2025年，Steam新增了两万款游戏，50%评测数不足10篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">1:18:00</a> 阿盐第一次尝试给自己的游戏做宣发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5045">1:24:05</a> Demo以外，做Playtest也有意义</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4115510/_/" data-url="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4115510/_/"><span>《喵乐迪：律动幸存者》Steam页面</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3725910/_/" data-url="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3725910/_/"><span>《伦敦旧影》Steam页面</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3761680/_/" data-url="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3761680/_/"><span>《姐姐恋爱法则》Steam页面</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vibin' by Purrple Cat</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music promoted by chosic.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>Creative Commons CC BY 3.0</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6727295e33c798676f08779d/lpo_xW67wpBsKxplk_dF16Sa9XRq.m4a" length="85915400" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:28:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiomfyWOJsj6jSHgjwcpohBM-Jrb.png"/>
